        "narrow": true,
        "eyebrow": "THE BASICS",
        "heading": "What wholesale actually means",
        "body": "<p>You buy a pack at a lower price per unit than you'd pay for one, then sell each item on for more. Our minimum order quantities are deliberately low, so you can test a category without spending hundreds.</p>",
